WEBVTT

00:01.730 --> 00:05.230
<b>Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande... </b>

00:05.230 --> 00:10.240
<b>And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...</b>

00:10.240 --> 00:15.540
<b>This is the story of
their lives and adventures. </b>

00:20.160 --> 00:22.040
<b>Here we go, Lucario!</b>

00:23.790 --> 00:26.790
<b>Bursting with life! </b>

00:26.790 --> 00:28.420
<b>Mega Evolution!</b>

00:33.720 --> 00:35.050
<b>This is it!</b>

00:53.440 --> 00:55.820
<b>We’re not giving up!
Wood Hammer!</b>

01:01.160 --> 01:02.080
<b>Aura Sphere!</b>

01:07.670 --> 01:09.770
<b>Ahh! Haribogue!</b>

01:13.130 --> 01:17.340
<b>Haribogue is unable to battle.
Lucario wins!</b>

01:17.340 --> 01:20.970
<b>As such, the winner is
Gym Leader Corni!</b>

01:22.220 --> 01:23.520
<b>Corni!</b>

01:24.600 --> 01:26.940
<b>Oh, Satoshi!</b>

01:27.810 --> 01:30.060
<b>Nice fight!</b>

01:30.060 --> 01:33.150
<b>Lucario, that’s the key to
getting stronger!</b>

01:44.580 --> 01:46.960
<b>Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!</b>

01:46.960 --> 01:49.760
<b>You all packed and ready to leave?</b>

01:49.760 --> 01:52.260
<b>I'll show you this wide mysterious world</b>

01:52.260 --> 01:55.140
<b>And skip the slow send-off</b>

01:55.140 --> 01:57.640
<b>Be it through fire or through water</b>

01:57.640 --> 02:00.270
<b>I'm fumbling blindly through the days</b>

02:00.270 --> 02:05.190
<b>When I don't even know what the next second will bring</b>

02:05.190 --> 02:10.190
<b>Each and every one of my memories</b>

02:10.190 --> 02:14.700
<b>Can always be found inside a Ball</b>

02:15.490 --> 02:18.120
<b>On 1, 2, 3, dive in!</b>

02:18.120 --> 02:24.620
<b>I've got my plans for when I grow up in my pocket</b>

02:26.000 --> 02:30.840
<b>Greeting someone new is always fresh</b>

02:30.840 --> 02:35.090
<b>No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)</b>

02:35.090 --> 02:36.430
<b>Let's have a fight!</b>

02:36.430 --> 02:38.850
<b>1. Once the battle's done</b>

02:38.850 --> 02:40.970
<b>2. And we're laughing or crying</b>

02:40.970 --> 02:45.730
<b>On 3, let's be friends!</b>

02:46.440 --> 02:51.820
<b>Any day and every day, that's always been my rule</b>

02:51.820 --> 02:57.070
<b>With this unpredictable, unfathomable world awaiting</b>

02:57.070 --> 02:59.490
<b>Let's go! Every time you trip and fall</b>

02:59.490 --> 03:03.660
<b>Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side</b>

03:03.120 --> 03:06.420
PocketMonsters

03:03.660 --> 03:06.420
<b>I choose you!</b>

03:10.000 --> 03:15.430
<b>Lucarionite!</b>

03:10.000 --> 03:15.430
<b>A Great Adventure on Mega Island!!</b>

03:15.430 --> 03:19.430
<b>Shala City, Kalos Region</b>

03:16.460 --> 03:22.140
<b>Satoshi and Go have come to Kalos
to visit Corni, the Gym Leader of Shala Gym.</b>

03:22.140 --> 03:25.390
<b>Corni and Lucario
are as strong as ever!</b>

03:26.600 --> 03:29.640
<b>That was amazingly cool,
Ms. Corni!</b>

03:31.140 --> 03:33.100
<b>Oh, you really thought so...?</b>

03:33.100 --> 03:35.690
<b>What’s with the
“You really thought so”?</b>

03:35.690 --> 03:36.980
<b>Grandpa...</b>

03:36.980 --> 03:40.570
<b>Only lately have you even started
behaving like a proper Gym Leader.</b>

03:40.570 --> 03:44.240
<b>Gah. He’s always <i>so</i> critical...</b>

03:44.240 --> 03:47.870
<b>Go, are you still devoting yourself
to catching Pokémon?</b>

03:47.870 --> 03:51.000
<b>Yes! Thanks for before.</b>

03:51.540 --> 03:54.880
<b>Satoshi, congratulations on
entering the Hyper Class.</b>

03:54.880 --> 03:56.630
<b>Thank you!</b>

03:57.590 --> 03:59.670
<b>We’d better not fall behind either.</b>

04:00.300 --> 04:03.930
<b>Corni, I wanna Mega Evolve
my Lucario!</b>

04:04.930 --> 04:09.020
<b>So I can win my way through the Hyper Class,
and the Master Class after that!</b>

04:24.570 --> 04:26.200
<b>Okay, got it.</b>

04:26.700 --> 04:29.370
<b>I know the two of you can do it.</b>

04:29.370 --> 04:31.000
<b>Right, Lucario?</b>

04:35.210 --> 04:36.210
<b>Here, take this.</b>

04:36.670 --> 04:38.290
<b>A Mega Glove?</b>

04:39.210 --> 04:41.710
<b>So that’s a Key Stone...</b>

04:41.710 --> 04:43.090
<b>Thanks, Corni!</b>

04:43.090 --> 04:44.130
<b>Sure.</b>

04:44.130 --> 04:45.300
<b>Try putting it on.</b>

04:45.300 --> 04:46.340
<b>Okay!</b>

04:59.400 --> 05:01.730
<b>Looks like it could Mega Evolve
any second!</b>

05:01.730 --> 05:03.950
<b>No, no, it certainly couldn’t.</b>

05:03.950 --> 05:05.950
<b>For a Pokémon to Mega Evolve,</b>

05:05.950 --> 05:11.700
<b>the Key Stone held by the trainer,
and the Mega Stone held by the Pokémon need to resonate.</b>

05:13.080 --> 05:17.210
<b>Every Pokémon that Mega Evolves
has its own Mega Stone.</b>

05:17.210 --> 05:21.590
<b>In Lucario’s case,
you’d need a Lucarionite.</b>

05:21.590 --> 05:23.970
<b>Satoshi, Lucario...</b>

05:23.970 --> 05:26.970
<b>You’ll have to search
for that Lucarionite together.</b>

05:27.390 --> 05:32.770
<b>Satoshi receiving the Key Stone just now
has enhanced Lucario’s Aura.</b>

05:47.360 --> 05:50.200
<b>Oh, it can sense it...</b>

05:50.200 --> 05:52.290
<b>Naturally,
it’s pointing toward Mega Island.</b>

05:52.290 --> 05:53.410
<b>Yes.</b>

05:53.410 --> 05:54.870
<b>Mega Island?</b>

06:02.550 --> 06:03.880
<b>That was quite impressive.</b>

06:03.880 --> 06:07.840
<b>It picked up the location of
the Lucarionite straight away.</b>

06:07.840 --> 06:12.890
<b>This proves that you’ve
already formed a tight bond.</b>

06:15.890 --> 06:20.270
<b>Satoshi and Lucario <i>were</i> drawn to one another
when it was just an egg, after all.</b>

06:35.830 --> 06:37.750
<b>That’s Mega Island.</b>

06:37.750 --> 06:39.790
<b>The island suddenly appeared one day.</b>

06:40.170 --> 06:43.250
<b>We’ve learned that many Mega Stones
can be found there.</b>

06:43.250 --> 06:45.550
<b>And that’s why it’s called Mega Island.</b>

06:45.550 --> 06:50.430
<b>That may explain why wild Pokémon
that can Mega Evolve tend to gather there.</b>

06:50.430 --> 06:52.890
<b>There’s lots of Pokémon there?!</b>

07:05.820 --> 07:07.280
<b>Gyarados!</b>

07:11.320 --> 07:13.830
<b>Now this feels like a real adventure!</b>

07:19.460 --> 07:24.970
<b>Mega Island, Kalos Region</b>

07:20.670 --> 07:21.580
<b>Okay, then...</b>

07:21.580 --> 07:23.000
<b>See you later!</b>

07:23.000 --> 07:24.960
<b>Right.
Take care out there!</b>

07:25.340 --> 07:27.920
<b>Corni, watch after them, will you?</b>

07:27.920 --> 07:30.840
<b>Leave it to me, Grandpa! </b>

07:43.190 --> 07:45.320
<b>We found the Lucarionite already?!</b>

07:45.320 --> 07:46.820
<b>Let’s check it out!</b>

07:48.860 --> 07:49.900
<b>It’s moving!</b>

07:49.900 --> 07:51.820
<b>Stop!</b>

07:54.570 --> 07:55.490
<b>Huh?</b>

07:55.490 --> 07:56.870
<b>A Yamirami?</b>

07:59.910 --> 08:01.250
<b>What?! What’s happening?!</b>

08:05.420 --> 08:06.630
<b>No, no, no, no!</b>

08:18.350 --> 08:20.220
<b>You okay, Lucario?</b>

08:21.230 --> 08:23.650
<b>How do we get back up?</b>

08:23.650 --> 08:25.610
<b>We can have our Pokémon help!</b>

08:25.610 --> 08:28.020
<b>Pikachu, get my Monster Balls!</b>

08:30.240 --> 08:32.320
<b>Pikachu, mine too!</b>

08:46.290 --> 08:48.340
<b>Kairyu and Flygon...</b>

08:48.340 --> 08:50.670
<b>Corni, get on Flygon.</b>

08:50.670 --> 08:52.470
<b>Okay, I’ll give it a try.</b>

09:01.100 --> 09:03.480
<b>Kairyu, can you get us, too? </b>

09:09.150 --> 09:10.860
<b>Oh, a Yukinooh!</b>

09:13.490 --> 09:16.360
<b>So the Yukinooh’s
what made all that ice...</b>

09:16.360 --> 09:18.700
<b>I gotta say though...
Mega Island’s really cool!</b>

09:18.700 --> 09:21.490
<b>Satoshi,
don’t forget why we’re here...</b>

09:21.490 --> 09:25.160
<b>Oh, I know! Right, Lucario?</b>

09:28.170 --> 09:31.380
<b>Lucario, can you sense
where the Mega Stone is?</b>

09:40.010 --> 09:41.270
<b>Oh, a Bohmander!</b>

09:41.270 --> 09:42.400
<b>A Pidgeot?!</b>

09:55.200 --> 09:56.910
<b>Satoshi!</b>

09:56.910 --> 09:59.990
<b>Go! Lucario!</b>

10:04.540 --> 10:06.000
<b>Pocket Monsters!</b>

10:10.590 --> 10:15.510
<b>Lucario</b>

10:10.590 --> 10:15.510
<b>Steel</b>

10:10.590 --> 10:15.510
<b>Fighting</b>

10:18.340 --> 10:20.300
<b>Go... Lucario...</b>

10:21.050 --> 10:23.390
<b>Being in the air
can be dangerous...</b>

10:25.560 --> 10:27.520
<b>Kairyu, return.</b>

10:30.900 --> 10:32.480
<b>Thanks, Kairyu.</b>

10:33.980 --> 10:36.240
<b>They went over that way...</b>

10:36.240 --> 10:38.530
<b>I hope Flygon finds them.</b>

10:39.280 --> 10:40.910
<b>Let’s hurry and find them!</b>

10:40.910 --> 10:41.950
<b>Yeah!</b>

10:52.550 --> 10:55.640
<b>Hot, hot, hot, hot...</b>

10:59.390 --> 11:01.640
<b>What even is this place?!</b>

11:03.140 --> 11:03.890
<b>Flygon!</b>

11:05.140 --> 11:06.930
<b>Watch out! Return!</b>

11:12.360 --> 11:16.650
<b>Of course,
Steel types are weak to Fire.</b>

11:16.650 --> 11:18.150
<b>Well, then...</b>

11:18.150 --> 11:20.240
<b>Go, Hiyape!</b>

11:22.530 --> 11:23.780
<b>Rain Prayer!</b>

11:29.660 --> 11:31.170
<b>How’s that, Lucario?</b>

11:31.170 --> 11:33.880
<b>Now we can run
straight out of here!</b>

11:41.290 --> 11:43.260
<b>This is my chance to catch it!</b>

11:43.260 --> 11:45.310
<b>Monster Ball, go!</b>

11:54.400 --> 11:58.070
<b>Bakuda’s data will be
added to the Index!</b>

11:58.070 --> 12:00.360
<b>I caught Bakuda!</b>

12:03.160 --> 12:04.750
<b>Aceburn, help us out!</b>

12:06.410 --> 12:07.990
<b>Pyro Ball!</b>

12:14.830 --> 12:17.500
<b>Okay, let’s hurry out of here!</b>

12:21.050 --> 12:22.840
<b>Everybody okay?</b>

12:24.890 --> 12:27.270
<b>Aceburn, Hiyape, thanks!</b>

12:32.310 --> 12:34.560
<b>I’d better call Satoshi.</b>

12:37.690 --> 12:40.280
<b>Huh? I can’t get through...</b>

12:50.410 --> 12:51.580
<b>Lucario?</b>

12:59.420 --> 13:01.090
<b>The Key Stone...</b>

13:01.090 --> 13:03.220
<b>It must be Lucario’s Aura.</b>

13:04.300 --> 13:06.470
<b>Satoshi, can you sense anything?</b>

13:24.650 --> 13:26.030
<b>Lucario...</b>

13:27.870 --> 13:29.030
<b>Lucario...</b>

13:52.020 --> 13:53.310
<b>It’s Lucario!</b>

13:55.100 --> 13:56.190
<b>Was that Satoshi?</b>

13:56.190 --> 13:58.070
<b>Is Satoshi okay?!</b>

14:02.530 --> 14:06.150
<b>I felt Lucario, through its Aura!</b>

14:06.150 --> 14:07.490
<b>Really?!</b>

14:07.490 --> 14:09.410
<b>Your bond’s incredible!</b>

14:09.410 --> 14:12.080
<b>I saw Go and Sarunori
inside its Aura, too.</b>

14:12.080 --> 14:13.490
<b>They’re all together!</b>

14:28.430 --> 14:29.840
<b>Let’s go, Corni!</b>

14:30.850 --> 14:32.230
<b>To Lucario, right?</b>

14:32.720 --> 14:36.180
<b>Lucario found the Mega Stone!
I could feel it!</b>

14:36.180 --> 14:37.350
<b>What?!</b>

14:37.730 --> 14:41.080
<b>If we head for the Mega Stone, we’ll meet up with Lucario and Go!</b>

14:42.070 --> 14:44.730
<b>Aura’s incredible...</b>

14:49.490 --> 14:51.490
<b>I get it, Lucario!</b>

14:51.490 --> 14:53.280
<b>I can sense it too!</b>

15:10.130 --> 15:12.260
<b>It’s smooth...</b>

15:41.620 --> 15:43.290
<b>What is this place...?</b>

15:43.290 --> 15:45.460
<b>It’s the Steel Forest.</b>

15:45.460 --> 15:47.170
<b>The Steel Forest?</b>

15:49.090 --> 15:50.550
<b>Lucario!</b>

15:52.590 --> 15:55.050
<b>I could sense your Aura!</b>

15:56.810 --> 16:00.560
<b>Satoshi, Lucario thinks
something’s here...</b>

16:01.980 --> 16:03.410
<b>The Lucarionite?</b>

16:06.110 --> 16:08.610
<b>So the Lucarionite’s
inside this thing...</b>

16:13.530 --> 16:15.740
<b>We’re gonna get it out!
Aura Sphere!</b>

16:39.470 --> 16:41.480
<b>The Lucarionite?</b>

16:43.480 --> 16:45.650
<b>Why isn’t it falling?!</b>

16:46.440 --> 16:48.690
<b>Oyoyoyoyo!</b>

16:48.690 --> 16:53.910
<b>Oyoyoyo! Correct!</b>

16:53.910 --> 16:55.990
<b>There’s an astute guess!</b>

16:55.990 --> 17:01.830
<b>The Mega Evolution Sage,
that would be me!</b>

17:01.830 --> 17:03.790
<b>The Mega Evolution Sage?!</b>

17:03.790 --> 17:04.960
<b>What’s that about?!</b>

17:05.330 --> 17:07.000
<b>And he’s floating!</b>

17:08.800 --> 17:12.380
<b>Oyoyoyo, there’s a new face.</b>

17:12.380 --> 17:17.300
<b>If you want this Lucarionite,
then take it from me!</b>

17:18.720 --> 17:19.810
<b>Houdin...</b>

17:19.810 --> 17:21.640
<b>We never agreed to any of this!</b>

17:21.640 --> 17:23.180
<b>Don’t worry, Go.</b>

17:23.560 --> 17:25.190
<b>I’m taking your challenge!</b>

17:25.940 --> 17:28.190
<b>You’ve got it!</b>

17:30.360 --> 17:32.940
<b>Oyoyoyoyo!</b>

17:33.360 --> 17:38.580
<b>The fight for the
Lucarionite starts now!</b>

17:38.580 --> 17:40.580
<b>He’s really throwing me off...</b>

17:40.580 --> 17:45.540
<b>The Mega Evolution Sage,
everyone’s hero, unveils his powers!</b>

17:45.540 --> 17:48.210
<b>Now! Mega Evolve!</b>

18:09.360 --> 18:12.110
<b>Mega... Houdin...</b>

18:16.150 --> 18:18.620
<b>Let’s go, Lucario! Aura Sphere!</b>

18:20.990 --> 18:22.620
<b>Psycho Beam!</b>

18:29.790 --> 18:31.090
<b>Shadow Clones!</b>

18:32.500 --> 18:34.840
<b>Oyoyo... Fire the spoons!</b>

18:38.970 --> 18:40.890
<b>Go for it!</b>

18:40.890 --> 18:43.010
<b>Tri Attack!</b>

18:56.650 --> 18:59.160
<b>The move paralyzed it!</b>

18:59.160 --> 19:02.080
<b>Oyoyo, that was a success.</b>

19:02.080 --> 19:07.670
<b>Tri Attack’s a move that can deal out
a burn, a freeze, or paralysis.</b>

19:10.290 --> 19:11.670
<b>It can still keep going...</b>

19:12.090 --> 19:13.290
<b>Lucario, jump!</b>

19:20.930 --> 19:23.010
<b>Lucario, hang in there!</b>

19:25.520 --> 19:27.020
<b>Jump again!</b>

19:37.110 --> 19:38.400
<b>You can do it!</b>

19:46.490 --> 19:47.670
<b>Oyoyoyoyoyo!</b>

20:00.170 --> 20:02.970
<b>We got the Lucarionite!</b>

20:04.430 --> 20:06.970
<b>All right!</b>

20:11.640 --> 20:13.730
<b>Congratulations!</b>

20:13.730 --> 20:15.980
<b>You did it, Lucario!</b>

20:15.980 --> 20:18.150
<b>That was amazing!</b>

20:25.330 --> 20:30.210
<b>The Mega Evolution Sage,
everyone’s hero, was actually...</b>

20:33.290 --> 20:35.840
<b>A little surprise of mine!</b>

20:35.840 --> 20:39.710
<b>Satoshi and Lucario,
you have a marvelous bond!</b>

20:39.710 --> 20:41.880
<b>Thank you for
guiding them here, Corni.</b>

20:41.880 --> 20:44.300
<b>You always go too far, Grandpa...</b>

20:44.300 --> 20:45.180
<b>Huh?</b>

20:45.180 --> 20:47.600
<b>You knew about this, Corni?</b>

20:47.600 --> 20:48.930
<b>Seriously?!</b>

20:48.930 --> 20:52.480
<b>Oyoyo! Oh, this was fun.</b>

20:52.480 --> 20:54.150
<b>Perhaps I should do it
again sometime.</b>

20:56.520 --> 21:00.150
<b>Satoshi and Lucario’s newfound power,
Mega Evolution...</b>

21:01.190 --> 21:07.280
<b>...is sure to have a great impact on their upcoming
Pokémon World Championships Hyper Class battles.</b>

21:10.870 --> 21:13.000
<b>Let’s get stronger, Lucario!</b>

21:24.010 --> 21:27.680
<b>My next opponent in the
Hyper Class’s been decided!</b>

21:29.060 --> 21:31.060
<b>Ms. Saito?!</b>

21:32.060 --> 21:34.310
<b>A third battle, huh...?</b>

21:34.310 --> 21:35.980
<b>I’ll beat her this time!</b>

21:35.980 --> 21:39.270
<b>Let’s settle the score, Lucario!</b>

21:53.250 --> 21:55.420
<b>Super Effective Type</b>

21:55.750 --> 21:58.550
Water is super effective on Ground!

21:58.550 --> 22:01.130
Soak them and watch them dissolve!

22:01.130 --> 22:03.970
Ground is super effective on Electric!

22:03.970 --> 22:06.390
They don’t even feel a shock!

22:06.390 --> 22:09.430
Electric is super effective on Flying!

22:09.430 --> 22:12.190
Hear the thunder rumble through the sky!

22:12.190 --> 22:14.860
Flying is super effective on Bug!

22:14.860 --> 22:17.400
They’re easy marks when flying high above!

22:17.400 --> 22:20.150
Learn how the 18 types interact

22:20.150 --> 22:22.570
Now then, everyone, think about this!

22:22.450 --> 22:33.710
Messon

22:22.570 --> 22:33.750
Wanpachi

22:23.200 --> 22:25.780
Swiftly swimming: the Water type!

22:25.780 --> 22:28.490
Pulsing with electricity: the Electric type!

22:28.490 --> 22:31.120
Which type is super effective?!

22:32.540 --> 22:33.830
Electric!

22:33.830 --> 22:39.090
Lots of Pokémon with all sorts of types

22:35.920 --> 22:37.880
Dragon

22:38.920 --> 22:40.550
Ice

22:39.090 --> 22:44.510
They're all unique and all intriguing

22:41.380 --> 22:42.930
Steel

22:44.090 --> 22:44.930
Psychic

22:44.510 --> 22:49.930
Everyone, what types are your Pokémon?

22:45.600 --> 22:45.680
What type is this Pokémo

22:57.230 --> 22:57.270
Ghost

23:07.200 --> 23:09.610
<b>Now! Onto the next adventure!</b>

23:09.610 --> 23:10.910
<b>Go!</b>

23:11.450 --> 23:15.870
<b>My next Hyper Class opponent
is Saito, once again!</b>

23:16.620 --> 23:18.210
<b>This is your third battle.</b>

23:18.210 --> 23:20.960
<b>And the battlefield is in Galar.</b>

23:20.960 --> 23:23.210
<b>She might even use Kyodaimax!</b>

23:23.210 --> 23:24.000
<b>Yeah.</b>

23:24.000 --> 23:26.590
<b>But we’ve got
Mega Evolution on our side!</b>

23:26.590 --> 23:28.800
<b>Lucario, let’s go!</b>

23:28.800 --> 23:30.340
